<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Note that whether we do the &quot;inner&quot; finite difference approximation first or the &quot;outer&quot; does not matter. This allows us to conveniently define approximations for <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>as well.</Text-field>
